cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite this repository."
type: software
title: "Atris"
abstract: >-
  Atris is an algorithm for large-scale modularity maximization with approximation
  guarantees. It combines a feasible community partition with a strengthened
  semidefinite relaxation and independent numerical verification to establish
  how close the partition's modularity is to the global optimum.
authors:
